Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shots of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gillest Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to keep my\NMillennium Puzzle, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It belongs to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that puzzle will free Joey from
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick's mind control\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that anchor's going to fall\Ninto the ocean in about 20 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,taking me and Joey with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Joey comes to his senses\Nsoon, we may be able to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave him my puzzle as a\Nsymbol of our friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,just like he gave me his red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know our bond is\Nstronger than Merrick's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already seen signs of\NMerrick's power weakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When Joey saw his red eyes black dragon,\Nit triggered something inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.19,0:01:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick may be able to control Joey's\Nmind, but he can't control Joey's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to bribe you with that puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi is your enemy, and I am\Nyour master, so listen to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The puzzle must be won in a\Nduel in order to use its magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So until we win this\Nduel, it's useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.05,0:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now destroy Yu-Gi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.09,0:02:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Yu-Gi! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So get rid of his Millennium Puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurl it into the ocean\Nso Yugi can't weaken us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And once we win this duel, I'll send my\Nrare hunters into the sea to retrieve the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,puzzle It's destiny And I will not be\Ndenied my fate Say goodbye to your puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,little Yugi Fight it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.71,0:02:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, the only thing I'm fighting\Nis you. That's right. Show
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi you don't need it And\Nthrow that thing into the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind slave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell Wait, Joey, don't\Ndo it Do it Please, stop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandpa just gave me that puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you wimps had enough,\Nor do you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not through with you just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.81,0:03:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are my friends, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this\Nkid's standing up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after I tossed his\Npuzzle out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This Yugi's a true pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Through it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.69,0:03:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.21,0:03:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,toss his puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and dispose of that puzzle. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my grip again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the puzzle if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.57,0:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle or no puzzle, you'll\Ndestroy Yu-Gi for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little friendship\Nplan won't work, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend's mind belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:03:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:03:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, get on with the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner you make your move, the\Nsooner I can eliminate your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'd better act quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,because you only have 14\Nminutes before that anchor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,pulls you and your best friend\Ninto the ocean's depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of my way once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, little Yugi. Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your turn is now over,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes regains 500 of the attack\Npoints it lost last turn, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Beta the Magnet Warrior could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to free Joey's mind\Nfrom Merrick's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And last turn, when Merrick forced\Nhim to attack his favorite card,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-Eyes Black Dragon, the\Nreal Joey, broke through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have to make that happen again if I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.21,0:04:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,going to save him and\Nget us out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But Red Eyes is weak, and\Nif it does get attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I could lose this Duel Tamaric\Nand put the whole world in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I place two cards face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I summon Beta the\NMagnet Warrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He could have attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, he left himself wide\Nopen for us to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.17,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't disappoint me now. It's\Ntime to end this. Excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Panther Warrior is strong enough to\Ndestroy that Red Eyes And Yugi too Destroy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, that's right, my obedient\Nservant, so do it. Alright, little Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.77,0:05:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,time to wipe out your Red Eyes\Nand your life points Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you're losing him Merrick's\Nhold on Joey is getting stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.89,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy, destroy Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Panther Warrior. You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, before I strike, I'll transform\NRocket Warrior into its invincible mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It all ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:06:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His red-eyes black dragon is barely alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That pathetic creature\Nwon't stand a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,against Panther Warrior's\Nferocious onslaught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And when that red-eyes goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So does Yugi. That little runt\Nhas only 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over. It's the moment\NI've been waiting for. Now, Wheeler,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.53,0:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,attack his red-eyes with your Panther\NWarrior I'll attack with Rocket Warrior What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.79,0:06:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And the target shall be\NYugi's Magnet Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But I commanded you to take\Nout his red-eyes, Wheeler
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be. He's not responding\Nto the power of my Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Rod Not so fast I reveal my face\Ndown trap Activate magic arm shield
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll intercept your rocket\Nwarrior. And redirect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:07:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the rocket attack Towards\Nyour panther warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to your attrition magic card\NPanther Warrior loses 1,500 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing its strength\Nall the way down to 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, because Rocket Warrior\Nwas in its invincible mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,your monster loses 500 extra attack\Npoints, leaving it with zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick would have attacked\Nmy Red Eyes to win the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but Joey must have stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, my mind slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears you have a tendency to disobey\Nmy orders and disrespect my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I assure you, my Millennium Rod\Nis not a force to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is keep\Nyou under my control
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,long enough to destroy\Nlittle Yugi forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really worried about Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:07:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's fine, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.15,0:08:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably on his way to the\NBattle City Finals right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless the same thugs that\Nattacked us got to him also. Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my poor brother Nice going The next\Ntime I need some words of encouragement
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Remind me not to call you But I\NI'm sure he's dueling in the finals
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,right now We have to find out where\Nthe finals are The quickest way is
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,to find some duelist And hope that\Nhe has six locator cards Let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's one Hang on, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you. Make your\Npathetic move, little Yugi. Fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick. And since Rocket Warrior's\Neffect is over, my Panther Warrior regains
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,the 500 attack points it lost Big
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.55,0:08:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,deal Watch this move I sacrifice Beta,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.57,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magnet Warrior. So I can summon my\NBeast of Guilford. I'll save you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:09:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my mighty beast,\Nattack his rocket warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.31,0:09:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, unlike your dragon,\NI've got plenty of strength left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Merrick's magic card, Red Eyes\Nis down to a measly 900 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't let it get destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be my only hope to save Joey\Nand the entire world from Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's only a\Nmatter of time before you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and your pathetic friend\Nare out of my way for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you only\Nhave one locator card?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a hike, and you\Ncall yourself a duelist?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys have any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.95,0:09:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I couldn't find any duelists at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me for trying to help. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That Duke Devlin's got a lot of nerve\Nholding Serenity's hand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those Cape Creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And they spotted us. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.93,0:10:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll catch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just take Serenity\Nand run. Huh? And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.21,0:10:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some unfinished\Nbusiness to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moving it. Here, Serenity. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We got one. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see who's got who\Nwhen this thing's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So who's gonna be first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross on the green, not in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.65,0:10:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being chased by a\Ngang of robed weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're comfortable, little Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In the front row seat to\Nyour friend's last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as no one\Ninterferes, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't say the same for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In less than ten minutes, the anchor\Nhanging above you will drop into the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,taking you and your friend Joey with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you goons haven't had enough, there's\Nplenty more where that came from. Well
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,where are my friends you freak spill it\Nnow domino pier they better be it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,hey tristan need a lift hey my how did\Nyou all end up together i told her we were
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,pals with you and joey and she said hop in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.05,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,all right tristan based\Non your description
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,of those creeps they sound like these rare\Nhunters i've been hearing about lately
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and what's a rare hunter they're underground\Nduelists that lie cheat and steal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,their goal is collecting rare cards and\Nthat's probably why they kidnapped your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,friends this isn't the\Nway turn around sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it is see i won six locator cards i know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,where they are they're not there my\Nthey're at a pier on the other side of the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,city are you sure Tristan yep I got it\Nstraight from those creeps so let's go right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,hold on tight do not try this at home
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we're coming to get you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely contain my\Nexcitement little Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,say goodbye to the rest\Nof your life points
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Skull dice, this trap card may\Nhelp. Either way, I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win if little Yugi's life points are
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,reduced to zero But\Nthat's not the only way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When the timer runs out,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll automatically win.\NWhile Yugi and his best
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,friend Wheeler are\Nreunited again in the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, once Yu-Gi is defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll possess his Millennium Puzzle and his\NEgyptian God card, Slifer the Sky Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to lose everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to break free!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what we do, he'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can destroy him\Nwith our magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just keep waiting when time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's just say I'll be the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I bring up more old stories,\Nmaybe he'll remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.99,0:13:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember Duelist Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Think back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember how you wanted to win so you\Ncould pay for your sister's operation?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity was your inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to you, she'll see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:13:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we've got to get\Nher into surgery now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.19,0:14:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept your promise to her, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget the\Npledge you made to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll whoop this Merrick\Ncreep and his rare hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,goon squad so hard they\Nwon't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be sorry they ever\Ndecided to mess with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've never broken a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I promise to annihilate you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Yugi. So I place two\Ncards face down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And my turn So try and attack\Nmy Panther Warrior If you dare
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he does,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.25,0:14:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him Little Yugi can try to reason\Nwith his friend Joey all he wants He'll
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,never break the power\Nof my Millennium Rod And
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,soon victory will be\Nmine Excellent dueling,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind slave. It's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.95,0:15:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized that\Nyour friend isn't coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with me now, and I'm\Nabout to take everything away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to snap out of this, Chewie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card may help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast of Guilford, attack\Nhis Panther Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for your own good, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fallen right into\Nmy trap, little Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.57,0:15:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and your foolish mistake\Nwill cost you dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as your beast\Nattacks, you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilfer, roast his panther\Nwith your flame attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rawr!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal my skull dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And just to make sure my move works,\NI'll add this card, my Graceful Dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop his attack, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Dice will increase my monster's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points according\Nto the roll of the die,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,while Skull Dice reduces\Nyour monster's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.47,0:16:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm feeling very lucky today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.43,0:16:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I reveal my magic card, Dispel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use it to destroy your Graceful Dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.95,0:16:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but now you can't raise the attack\Npoints of your panther warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still weaken your monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.81,0:16:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Skulldice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that only cuts my\Nmonster's attack strength in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My panther's doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to crash this party, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be fine, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,With me on your side,\Nyou can't lose, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get Joey out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and pretty soon you'll be\Nwatching him duel in the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's going on over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.41,0:17:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have destroyed my Panther\NWarrior, but you're about to lose this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In just over five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll sink to the bottom\Nof the sea while I acquire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,your Egyptian God card and\Nyour Millennium puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my last chance to get\Nthrough to Joey and save us both!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi only has 1,000 life points left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more major attack by Joey, and that\Nanchor's gonna take him down, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that timer runs out first, Yugi\Nand Wheeler will both be fish food. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.15,0:17:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:17:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try to save Taya,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,that rare hunter will release\Nthe crate hanging above her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to risk, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So we don't break up Joey and Yugi's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that's it, Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,just look at the dueling\Nsetup these guys put together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys don't mess around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what's the deal with\Nthe anchor and the chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And how come Yugi and Joey are\Ndueling in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, will someone please\Ntell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend, Wheeler,\Nis on their side. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, whose side?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow Joey lost his mind, and now\Nhe's dueling on the rare hunter's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever loses gets pulled\Nto the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't. My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Serenity see Joey like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, please don't\Ntake your bandages off yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you have to trust\Nme on this one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity lives for her big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If her first sight is Joey\Npossessed by some evil nutcase,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,she would never get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.53,0:19:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can save Joey, Yugi can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just let the timer run\Nout, destroying you and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But out dueling you will\Nbe so much more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, all of your little friends\Nare here to witness your demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteor of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, my mind slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the card we need to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, play it and win me that puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And destroy your best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One more move and you'll be gone\Nfor good while I rule the world!
